{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木坂ってどこ？は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Second選抜の発表でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は発表の場にいませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員参加だった収録に出れなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分は今回のチャンスを逃してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーとして頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を応援してくださるみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待に応えられなくて本当にごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで、アンダーでいたとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛くて苦しい経験を味わいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はスケジュール連絡が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールで送られてくるのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーがOFFの日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜メンバーが頑張っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家で何もすることがなく、ただ悔しくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜は今何をしているのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもそのことから頭が離れなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだけじゃまだ足りないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと辛い経験をして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと強くならなきゃいけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら努力したその分、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対返ってくるんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜が理由があって出演できないとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代わりに出演して、舞台に立てた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台に立てる！踊れる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時私は大きなチャンスをもらったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代わり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけども、舞台に立てた時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「このチャンスを逃したくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山アピールしなきゃ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とひたすら歌って踊りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Second選抜に選ばれたメンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当におめでとう＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜の支えになります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"任せてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かあったら言ってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも絶対絶対負けない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくださるみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かあったらここではき出していいよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と優しく言ってくださるみなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい。悔しくてたまらない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送を見てすごい泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんわん泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録に出たかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの場で発表を聞きたかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのコメントを読んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待に応えられなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣かないで、前に進もう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言ってくださったみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちを入れ変えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーとして、何ができるか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に足りないものは何か"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一度よく考えて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に進みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"坂を上ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも私の背中を押してください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛い時があれば泣きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも絶対、最高の笑顔を忘れないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんの笑顔が好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言ってくださるみなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑って‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","tex